  [PASS] LIM-1  the CAM static field equation (mu Phi')' = rho/4M^2 (L108/L109) reduces, as mu -> 1, to the ORDINARY Poisson equation Phi'' = rho/4M^2 -- standard Newtonian gravity in the Solar System   ((mu Phi')' -> Phi'' as mu->1 (Newtonian Poisson))

